---
// src/components/WhyUseImageConverter.astro
---
<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto my-14 px-4">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Use Our Image Converter?</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base mt-2">Simple, private, and fast image conversions designed for everyday work.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <!-- Card 1: Fastest Converter -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2">Fastest Converter</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your photos convert directly inside your web browser using your device CPU. Because files never travel across the internet to a remote queue, your conversions finish in seconds without waiting for upload progress bars.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: All Formats -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2">All Formats</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Convert between all major web and graphic formats including WebP, AVIF, PNG, JPG, and SVG, alongside camera RAW captures. Switch image containers freely whether preparing assets for website speed, print jobs, or design projects.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Browser-Based -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2">Browser-Based</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Everything runs right inside your current browser tab without installing third-party apps, desktop software, or browser extensions. Open the tool from any device running Windows, macOS, Linux, iOS, or Android and start converting instantly.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: Private & Secure -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2">Private & Secure</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your files never touch external servers or third-party cloud storage. All image processing stays confined to your private local device memory, guaranteeing complete data confidentiality for confidential work files and personal photos.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 5: Bulk Image Converter -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2">Bulk Image Converter</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Queue multiple photos at once to speed up repetitive image conversions without arbitrary limits. Convert your entire image queue together and package everything into an organized ZIP archive ready for a single-click download.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 6: High-Quality Image Converter -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-2">High-Quality Image Converter</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Conversions maintain photographic sharpness, accurate color spaces, and transparent backgrounds without muddy compression artifacts or washed-out tones. Your exported images remain clear and true to the original source file.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
